---
config:
  theme: redux-dark
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API
    participant SQLite
    participant PostgreSQL
    Client->>API: HTTP Request (e.g., GET /v1/allergies/search?term=...)
    activate API
    Note over API: Request Intercepted & Process Started
    API->>SQLite: Query Allergy Data (e.g., SELECT * WHERE norm_... LIKE ...)
    activate SQLite
    SQLite-->>API: Return Allergy Data
    deactivate SQLite
    API->>PostgreSQL: Log Request Details (INSERT INTO request_logs...)
    activate PostgreSQL
    PostgreSQL-->>API: Log Commit OK
    deactivate PostgreSQL
    Note over API: Prepare HTTP Response
    API-->>Client: HTTP Response (e.g., 200 OK + Allergy Data JSON)
    deactivate API
